Description: Provides a traceable database of standard thermodynamic
    properties (enthalpy and Gibbs energy of formation, entropy, heat capacity
    and volume) of chemical species at 298.15 K and 1 bar. The data are
    imported without modification from the OBIGT database distributed with the
    'CHNOSZ' package and are organised by chemical nature. A unified interface
    returns documented values together with their source and reference
    conditions. Missing values are reported as missing, never estimated.
